# =========================
# Terraform
# =========================
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Terraform variable values live in the maintainers' private operations
# checkout, because operator_cidrs carries operator IP ranges and gitignored
# only keeps a file out of the history, not out of reach of a stray `git add`
# here. On a wired machine each of these paths is a symlink to the private copy,
# so Terraform loads its values from the working directory as it always has;
# ignoring the paths keeps the values from ever becoming committable here again.
# The sensitive half of each environment's values sits in a companion
# secrets.auto.tfvars, which is gitignored in the private checkout too and whose
# canonical copy is the vault.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
!*.tfvars.sample

