# Authenticated group and vote scraper output. The group captures carry member
# personal data (roster names, profile ids, group membership); the vote captures
# carry per-vote metadata and per-option totals, not individual ballots. The
# canonical home for all of it is the private ops repo, and the pipeline reaches
# the two group files here by canonical-named symlinks, so these paths can exist
# in a wired checkout and must never become committable.
legacy_data/group_files.csv
legacy_data/group_files/
legacy_data/group_files_*.csv
legacy_data/group_members.csv
